  "prefLabel": "Env-A 4803.05 Quantity of CO2 Allowances Available",
  "priorExpiration": "2009-03-30",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Env-A 4803.05 Quantity of CO2 Allowances Available.\n\n(a) Prior to the end of each control period, CO2 allowances in a quantity equal to the number of CO2 allowances allocated by the department to the NHAA in accordance with RSA 125-O:26 for such control period shall be made available for sale.\n\n(b) CO2 allowances shall be made available for sale by allocation year.\n\nSource. #9284, INTERIM, eff 10-1-08, EXPIRED: 3-30-09\n\nNew. #9445, eff 4-3-09; ss by #10470, eff 1-1-14; ss by #13974, eff 5-23-24",
  "source": "https://github.com/GraniteState/adm-rules-data/blob/1c92d82e0f03a582ca5b7a578588edf38de2318e/raw/2026-11-15/state_agencies/env-a4800.html"
}
